      {
        "h_title": "Phuket Airport Transfers",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport Transfers",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Book your discounted Phuket International Airport transfers starting from just £2.98 with FREE cancellations up to 24 hours before departure.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If Paradise were to exist on Earth, it would probably look a lot like Phuket. A jewel in the glittering Andaman Sea, this Thai resort has long been a favourite of travellers of all ages, with relaxed retreats, a vibrant party scene and impossibly beautiful scenery. With our transfers from Phuket Airport, we can get you to resorts around the island in as little as 50 minutes, to popular destinations such as Kamala Beach, Patong, Krabi, Karon Beach and locations across the town.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Cover if your transfer doesn't go to plan.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Friendly and fast support when you need it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Free cancellations 24 hours before travel.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Expertise with all ancillary travel services.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
