      {
        "h_title": "What happens once I’ve booked my airport transfer?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport Transfers",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "So you've booked your Phuket airport transfers from Osaka Airport. with Holiday Extras. Hooray! You can now sit back, relax and feel smug about the great decision you have made. We take care of the leg work, so all you have to worry about is how many bathing suits to pack.",
            "url": "https://www.holidayextras.com/airport-transfers.html",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.holidayextras.com/airport-transfers.html",
                "anchor_text": "airport transfers"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "You will receive an email booking confirmation, which is super important, so make sure you keep a copy somewhere safe, as you will need it when you take your transfer.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "When you land in Phuket, and have wrestled your bags off the luggage carousel, head through to the Arrivals Hall.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "What happens next will depend on which transfer you have chosen. If you're on a shared shuttle, you will be met by a representative who will show you to your awaiting vehicle.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If you've opted for a private transfer, keep an eye out for someone holding a board with your name on it. This is your driver, and they will whisk you off to your accommodation.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If in doubt, your confirmation has got all the details on it, so give it a read.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What should I do if my flight is delayed?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport Transfers",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Delays are one of the lesser joys of travelling, but don't worry, we have a cunning plan just in case your plane gets held up en route. There is a contact number on your confirmation, if you give that number a call, you'll get through to your provider. They will then be able to let your driver know and assist you from there.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What about when it's time to come home?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport Transfers",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "All good things must come to an end and when it's time to say La kxn to Phuket, your return to the airport is taken care of.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
